 "description": "A public edge sends HTTPS traffic to one API replica in each of three zones. Zones A and B also run a handoff worker, and each worker calls the external CRM. Every API replica and every worker connects to the same zone-redundant managed database, drawn across the zones. Identity, DNS, secrets and deployment configuration are shared by all zones.",
